Moyn is fair to the Universal Declaration of Human Rights, adopted on the tenth of December nineteen forty eight.

2
00:00:07,161 --> 00:00:17,734
Its first article announced status equality, everyone born free and equal in dignity and rights, and after racism and genocide that was revolutionary.

3
