But it implies nothing more.

4
00:00:19,544 --> 00:00:27,890
There is no ceiling on the wealth gap; even the UN's expert on poverty admits there is no explicitly stated right to equality.

5
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:39,010
His thought experiment: one man could own everything, an absolute overlord, without violating human rights, so long as everyone's basic rights were met.

6
